    "options": [
      "3-D camera path",
      "Projected optical flow"
    ],
    "default": "3-D camera path"
  },
  {
    "id": "orbitScene",
    "type": "orbit",
    "teaches": "Rotating the strip confirms the translation direction lies in the image plane and is perpendicular to the viewing direction, not toward or away from the scene."
  }
]

DEMO STEPS (tween through these using goToStep(); each step drives the controls above):
[
